CM_ SG_ 429 OBJ_Sync_ID_14_0 "The ID of the Sync message, used to synchronize between signals in the system. Every new frame promotes the sync ID by one.";
CM_ SG_ 429 OBJ_CRC_14 "Calculated over all element signals. From the signal after the CRC until the first signal in the next elements OBJ_CRC_N+1  not including";
CM_ SG_ 429 OBJ_ID_14 "The detected object ID. Range is 1-255, while 0 indicates that the field in unfilled.";
CM_ SG_ 429 OBJ_Existence_Probability_14 "The existence probability of the vehicle";
CM_ SG_ 429 OBJ_Motion_Category_14 "Relevant for VD only. Full description of values can be found at the ACC guide.";
CM_ SG_ 429 OBJ_Object_Age_14 "The number of frames in which the object was recognized.";
CM_ SG_ 429 OBJ_Measuring_Status_14 "Measurment status. Old vs New marks if this is the first frame in which the object is reported. Predicted vs Measured marks if the report is raw or has been predicted forward in time using the measured dynamics and ego motion.";
CM_ SG_ 429 OBJ_Object_Class_14 "Indicates the object type. Uncertain is outputted in case the probability that a vehicle is a truck is very similar to the probability that it is a car.";
CM_ SG_ 429 OBJ_Class_Probability_14 "The probability of this type classification.";
CM_ SG_ 429 OBJ_Motion_Status_14 "MOVING - the object is moving STATIONARY - the object was never seen moving STOPPED -  the object was moving and has stopped MOVING_SLOWLY - the object is moving very slowly";
CM_ SG_ 429 OBJ_Motion_Orientation_14 "The direction of the targets heading compared to the host.";
CM_ SG_ 429 OBJ_Has_Cut_Lane_14 "Indicates whether the object cut the host's (right or left) lane. In case there are no lanes, indicates whether the objects is at most 1 meters away from the host.";
